                                In today's digital era, technology and the internet are deeply embedded in our daily routines. Every comment, photo, or piece of personal information we upload creates a permanent trail known as a <strong class="text-theme-cyan font-semibold">digital footprint</strong>.
                            </p>
                            <p class="text-sm md:text-base text-theme-light/90 leading-relaxed">
